\item the rate is shown along its \strong{main time scale}: age, or
duration in the state if the rate does not use age, or calendar time if
it uses neither (\code{axis} chooses another);
\item the main time scale is cut into \strong{bands} (1 year unless the observed
range is short), and in each band the \strong{occurrence/exposure rate}
